B.a8X=new A.as(B.fD,["Take advantage of five before five: your youth before your old age, your health before your sickness, your wealth before your poverty, your free time before your preoccupation, and your life before your death.","Al-Hakim & Al-Bayhaqi (Sahih)","The Messenger of Allah \ufdfa said"],t.l)
