B.awH=s(["Full 12-month Hijri grid with Gregorian overlay","White Days (Ayyam al-Beed) Sunnah fasting markers","Upcoming sacred Islamic events with countdowns","Interactive Gregorian to Hijri date converter"],t.s)
B.Kc=new A.j3("Islamic Hijri Calendar","Lunar Month Grid, White Days & Events","\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f","calendar","Explore the complete Islamic lunar calendar with month-by-month grid, White Days (Ayyam al-Beed: 13th-15th) fasting indicators, Friday Jumu'ah highlights, holy milestones (Ramadan, Eid, Ashura, Arafah), and a two-way Gregorian \u2194 Hijri date converter.")
