B.K7=new A.j3("Stories of the Prophets","25 Prophets Mentioned in the Quran","\ud83d\udcdc","prophets","Journey through the sacred biographies of all 25 Prophets of Allah, from Adam (AS) to the final Messenger Muhammad (\ufdfa). Features verified Quranic verses, miraculous events (Mu'jizat), milestone timelines, moral lessons, and their authentic Quranic Duas.")
