B.a9H=new A.as(B.i0,["What is the best time to book Hajj?","We recommend registering on Nusuk and preparing 6-12 months in advance. Early registration gives time for visa processing, mandatory vaccinations, and securing preferred packages."],t.l)
B.a9I=new A.as(B.i0,["How much does Hajj typically cost?","Hajj costs range depending on departure country, airline rates, and hotel tier. Standard packages typically run between $6,000 - $12,000 USD per pilgrim."],t.l)
B.a9J=new A.as(B.i0,["What vaccinations are mandatory?","Meningococcal (ACWY) vaccination is strictly mandatory for all pilgrims. COVID-19 and seasonal influenza vaccinations are also widely required."],t.l)
B.a9K=new A.as(B.i0,["Can women perform Hajj without a Mahram?","Saudi regulations now permit women of all ages to perform Hajj and Umrah in organized pilgrim groups without requiring an accompanying male guardian (Mahram)."],t.l)
B.a9G=new A.as(B.i0,["How physically demanding is Hajj?","Hajj requires walking between 5 to 15 km daily in high temperatures. Pilgrims should begin physical walking preparation several weeks before departure."],t.l)
B.a9F=new A.as(B.i0,["What is the difference between Hajj and Umrah?","Umrah can be performed at any time of year and consists of Ihram, Tawaf, and Sa'i. Hajj is mandatory once in a lifetime, occurs only during the specific days of Dhul Hijjah, and includes standing at Arafah, Muzdalifah, and Mina."],t.l)
